From a9aba94a7ba6d003744f6ba418fa789aa14343c6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alexander Koskovich <akoskovich@pm.me>
Date: Mon, 6 Jul 2026 22:05:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 08348/15333] media: iris: Add support for Milos (VPU v2.0)

Add support for the Milos Iris codec. This only supports the variant
found on the SM7635-AB that has half of it's pipes disabled via efuse.

Signed-off-by: Alexander Koskovich <akoskovich@pm.me>
Reviewed-by: Dmitry Baryshkov <dmitry.baryshkov@oss.qualcomm.com>
Signed-off-by: Bryan O'Donoghue <bod@kernel.org>
